<title>YEMEN: Yemen cabinet approves EU cooperation deal.</title>
<headline>Yemen cabinet approves EU cooperation deal.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen's cabinet on Wednesday approved a cooperation agreement with the European Union which was initialled in Brussels on April 21, Radio Sanaa said.</p>
<p>The deal, described as a non-preferential agreement providing most favoured nation treatment, replaces a 1984 pact and was modified to take account of the unification of North and South Yemen in 1990.</p>
<p>Yemen, a small independent oil producer, is one of the poorest countries in the Arab world.</p>
</text>
